{
    "spec_version": "v1.26",
    "identifier": "RP-AXE-Express-Sol",
    "name": "RP-AXE Express (Sol)",
    "abstract": "The recommended tools for RP-AXE plus the Sol planet pack instead of Real Solar System. Texture size is your choice per system: CKAN offers Sol's recommended sizes ticked (16K Earth and Mars, 8K Mercury, Venus, Jupiter and Saturn, 4K the rest; about 6 GB), and asks for any you untick. Needs Sol's CKAN repository added first. CKAN -> File -> Install from .ckan file, then RP-AXE-<ver>.ckan.",
    "description": "RP-AXE on Sol instead of Real Solar System. FIRST add Sol's metadata repository to CKAN (Settings -> Metadata Repositories -> New -> Sol, or the URL https://github.com/RSS-Reborn/CKAN-meta/archive/main.tar.gz) and refresh. Then install this preset, then RP-AXE-<version>.ckan (CKAN -> File -> Install from .ckan file, one file per install). TEXTURE SIZES: the recommendations CKAN shows first include twelve Sol texture packs (Sol-EarthSystem-16k, Sol-Mercury-8k, ...), ticked at Sol's recommended sizes (16K Earth and Mars, 8K Mercury, Venus, Jupiter and Saturn, 4K the rest; about 6 GB). Keep them ticked, or untick any system to choose its size: CKAN then asks for it (4K, 8K or 16K; all-4K is about 1.8 GB). Untick the other recommendations, which come from the dependencies and are not needed. Do not press Cancel, which aborts the whole install. Full notes: docs/SOL.md in the RP-AXE repository.",
    "author": [
        "miskoltrans"
    ],
    "version": "0.9.3",
    "kind": "metapackage",
    "license": "CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0",
